880	/// In the example below, the chain of stroke values is folded into a single
881	/// value: `4pt + red`.
882	///
883	/// ```example
884	/// #set rect(stroke: red)
885	/// #set rect(stroke: 4pt)
886	/// #rect()
887	/// ```
